# Claude working files: track these in THIS repo, overriding the global ~/.gitignore_global
# (which ignores `.claude` and `CLAUDE.md` across all repos). Machine-local bits stay out.
!CLAUDE.md
!.claude/
.claude/.DS_Store
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
